________________________________________
Key Points for Exam Revision
•	Pods run containers.
•	Deployments manage pods.
•	Jobs run one-time tasks.
•	Resources can be created imperatively or declaratively.
•	Services provide internal access.
•	Routes provide external access.
•	Labels help select and organize resources.

